units metal
atom_style spin
boundary p p f
atom_modify map array
timestep 0.0005
read_data seed.data
pair_style hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 3.7 spin/dmi 3.0
pair_coeff * * spin/exchange exchange 3.7 0.03862814 0.26627693 1.70359890
pair_coeff * * spin/dmi dmi 3.0 0.0035 0.0 0.0 1.0
compute eEX all pair spin/exchange
compute eDMI all pair spin/dmi
compute outsp all property/atom spx spy spz sp
compute sz all property/atom spz
compute msz all reduce ave c_sz
variable Mz equal c_msz
fix f1 all precession/spin zeeman 1.5 0.0 0.0 1.0 anisotropy 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix_modify f1 energy yes
thermo 2000
thermo_style custom step pe c_eEX c_eDMI f_f1 v_Mz
thermo_modify format float %.12f
fix f2 all langevin/spin 0.00001 1.0 123456
fix f3 all nve/spin lattice frozen
run 200
write_dump all custom final.dump id type x y z c_outsp[1] c_outsp[2] c_outsp[3] c_outsp[4] modify format float %.10f
